<item name='HFText'><text>Yes</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>1. User Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Placing An Order</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>1. Guide d'utilisation</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Commander</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>5</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>After the Admin person has pressed the "Got It!" button, the order number is assigned and you will receive an email notifying you that this has occurred.  To process the order, do the following:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  Follow the link in the Purchase Order Receipt you receive from the Admin person.  This will take you to your order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Press the "Print" button on the action bar.  </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Never, ever, ever print an order using File &gt; Print because we want to make sure you are using the printable version.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%'/>
