><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.0118in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  After printing the order, get the acquisition card information (card number and expiry date) from the cardholder and print this information on the order.  Print legibly!!</run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='0.8118in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4.  Have the cardholder sign the order.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>5.  Fax the order to the company and attach the fax confirmation sheet to the order.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>6.  Send the original, signed, faxed order and confirmation sheet to the Admin person.  They require this for reconciliation purposes.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	Dès que l'adjoint administratif clique sur la touche «Reçu», la base de données assigne un numéro de commande 	au document. Un courrier électronique vous le confirmera. Poursuivez le traitement de la commande de la façon 	suivante :</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.	Cliquez sur le lien du Reçu de bon de commande que l'adjoint administratif vous a envoyé de façon à retrouver votre 	commande.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.	Cliquez sur la touche «Imprimer» de la barre d'outils. </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Ne jamais imprimer une commande en utilisant le menu </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Fichier &gt; Imprimer</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='6' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run><picture
